        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Grace & Favour, Are You Being Served?\n- People: Jeremy Lloyd, David Croft\n- Organizations: BBC1\n- Topics: British sitcoms, spin-offs\n\nFacts:\n- Grace & Favour is a British sitcom and a spin-off of Are You Being Served?.\n- Grace & Favour aired on BBC1 for two series from 1992 to 1993.\n- Grace & Favour marked the return of Are You Being Served? creators and writers Jeremy Lloyd and David Croft.\n- John Jeremy Lloyd, OBE, was born on 22 July 1930 and died on 23 December 2014.\n- Jeremy Lloyd was an English writer, screenwriter, author, poet, and actor.\n- Jeremy Lloyd was best known as a co-author and writer of several successful British sitcoms, including Are You Being Served?.",
